- Canvas 히트맵: X축=파라미터 오차%, Y축=R 값, 색=안정(초록)/불안정(빨강)
- "안전 R 범위" 자동 추천

#### [NEW] [gain_calculator.js](file:///c:/Users/user/OneDrive%20-%20%EC%B6%A9%EB%B6%81%EA%B3%BC%ED%95%99%EA%B3%A0%EB%93%B1%ED%95%99%EA%B5%90/%EC%9B%90%EB%93%9C%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%8C%20%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%ED%99%94%20%ED%8F%B4%EB%8D%94/%EC%BD%94%EB%94%A9%20%EC%9E%91%EC%97%85%20%ED%8F%B4%EB%8D%94/slackline_valancing/deploy/src/tools/gain_calculator.js)
